### Estimated Implementation Effort

**Phase 1 - MVP:** 3-5 days (basic chat UI, message list, input)
**Phase 2 - Streaming:** 2-3 days (LiveView streams, chunk-by-chunk responses)
**Phase 3 - Rich Content:** 3-5 days (markdown, code highlighting, conversation management)
**Phase 4 - Advanced:** 5-7 days (file uploads, voice input, multi-agent)

**Total: 2-3 weeks for full LibreChat-style interface**

